<p>I don't like the way the indigenous people are described. To call their social heirarchy &quot;tribal&quot; is exceedingly vague, and to refer to their tools as such is basically meaningless. Going with just a tiny bit of specificity here could help; maybe something along the lines of &quot;&#8230;a social structure consisting of tribes of around [X] number of individuals, led by local chiefs. Their technology level is on par with that of the [A] culture from [B] island&quot; (filled in or redacted as you see fit). Not a big fan, either, of the Foundation giving the indigenous culture a cutesy nickname, and nowhere referring to them by the name they give themselves.</p>

